    "body": "This seems related to https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10957 but that was for the `iframe` case. The popup loads `about:blank`, which doesn't fire a `load` event per spec as far as I can tell, and [also not in browsers](https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/14823). I'd say it makes sense to match `about:blank` in this case.",
